<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Results - <%= card.title %></title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: #2ecc71;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .results-header {
            font-size: 0.95em;
            color: #999;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .results-content {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #2ecc71;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .section p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555;
        }

        .navigation {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 12px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .home-link {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            background: #999;
            color: white;
        }

        .home-link:hover {
            background: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">🔓 RESULTS UNLOCKED</div>

        <div class="breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/stakeholder-cards">Stakeholder Cards</a> / <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= card.id %>">Card <%= card.id %></a> / Results
        </div>

        <h1><%= card.title %></h1>

        <div class="results-header">
            Results for Card <%= card.id %>
        </div>

        <div class="results-content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>📊 What Happened?</h2>
                <p>This is placeholder text for the results section. Add the specific outcomes, feedback, and impact analysis for this decision here.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>💡 Key Insights</h2>
                <p>What did this decision reveal about stakeholder relationships? What were the consequences? What learning moments emerged?</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>🎯 Next Steps</h2>
                <p>What should be considered as a result of this decision? How does this inform future decisions in the simulation?</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>📝 Reflection</h2>
                <p>This is where you might include coaching questions or reflection prompts for the participant based on their decision.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="navigation">
            <% if (prevId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= prevId %>/results" class="nav-btn">← Card <%= prevId %> Results</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 1;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (nextId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= nextId %>/results" class="nav-btn">Card <%= nextId %> Results →</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 2;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= card.id %>" class="nav-btn">Back to Card <%= card.id %></a>
            <a href="/staff-cards" class="nav-btn">Staff Results</a>
            <a href="/" class="nav-btn home-link">← Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
